unt":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zvGNZF827KyzLupKiG4Xtw","review_id":"AG69Hi0RQ1nzmBNfE0y9uA","date":"2018-05-27T06:02:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9492479562759399,"text_excerpt":"I saw this place online and wanted to try it since we have been looking for a good crawfish boil. I was apprehensive walking to the place since we were from out of town and the area was farther away from the hub and seemed shady,but it turned out fine. We came right around 545pm the crawfish is served at 6, there were people at the bar and the seating areas and they all came for the crawfish! Tourists and locals. The beer was well priced ans buy 1 get one at that time. They give you a to go box that you fill up to the brim for $16. It's a fair price for so much food-they had crawfish,sausage,corn,mushrooms and other bits,but everything was deliciousness!!! You scoop your own. The place is..."},{"business_id":"zvGNZF827KyzLupKiG4Xtw","review_id":"SEkjJX7JsodwYB74RMJnLQ","date":"2018-05-26T18:33:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9472659826278687,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome! Found it on yelp while looking for a place to get crawfish and was not disappointed. When you walk in it just seems like any other bar, but on the side they have a HUGE cooler filled with crawfish. It was $16 per person and you serve yourself as much as you can fit in the take out container they give you. They also have great drink deals. Place was so good we went 2 days in a row. Looks they they have their crawfish boils Monday, Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday at 6p. Come here if you want to get your fill without spending $20 and up for less at the bougie places in the French quarter."},{"business_id":"zvGNZF827KyzLupKiG4Xtw","review_id":"u6vcYxVY8UEHWHorw6HNkg","date":"2017-05-26T05:47:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9443204998970032,"text_excerpt":"So I wanted a great crawfish boil at a reasonable price and I got it. I went on a Thursday night. First off the bartender lee is hilarious and awesome. So I hope you go a night he is working. They cook a large batch of them and keep the crawfish boil in a huge cooler. I got a take out box and just went to the cooler and filler her up. They had a two for one sale on beer so I got a huge thing of crawfish and two coronas for 24 dollars. It's a great place to sit chill eat crawfish and drink. It's also group friendly and has a huge projector for viewing Games. All in all a great find and would definitely go again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zvGNZF827KyzLupKiG4Xtw","photo_id":"jU8dBuN0iT9R9quxIPgtzw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jU8dBuN0iT9R9quxIPgtzw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8841138482093811},{"business_id":"zvGNZF827KyzLupKiG4Xtw","photo_id":"f1l5kJ9hzLaVKuxrh8l9aQ","label":"outside","image_